OL,12,G2200 Timber Titans
OL,13,     FDisaster strikes as a river pounds
OL,14,     Fthe Fraser Valley, dramatically
OL,15,     Fhalting operations. The Peters
OL,16,     Fcrew faces their toughest setback
OL,17,     Fwhen their yarder becomes trapped
OL,18,     Fby flooding.
